WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.520
Episode 12

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.520
No Way Out<i>!
</i>Hopeful and Hellish Stars of Orion

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.520
( Air date: Dec 22, 1974 )

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:40.220
Space Battleship

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:40.220
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:41.670
In 2199, Earth was attacked by forces
from the mysterious planet, Gamilus.

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:47.280
{CHIKYUU GUN}The Earth Defense Forces fought Gamilus
with all their might, but were defeated.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:51.400
{CHIKYUU}Earth was devastated by the
meteor bombs from Gamilus.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:55.170
{HITOBITO}People were barely surviving by
escaping to underground cities, but...

00:01:55.170 --> 00:02:00.530
{HOUSHANOU}...mankind will be extinct in one year,
due to the radioactive contamination.

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:04.620
{SHIKASHI}However, 148,000 light years away...

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:09.270
{SHIKASHI}...there is a radioactive purifier on planet
Iscandar in the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:13.170
{CHIKYUU}The Yamato, the first Earth ship
to exceed the speed of light...

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:18.800
{CHIKYUU}...has begun a journey of 148,000 light years to Iscandar to obtain the radioactive purifier.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:22.020
{YAMATO}The Yamato has
left our Solar System...

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:25.820
{YAMATO}...and continues traveling through the
Galactic System toward outer space.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.270
Yuki.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:38.650
What're you doing ?

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:41.380
Can't you tell by looking ?

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:42.960
I'm praying.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:43.820
To what ?

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:48.440
The Alpha of the trinary
of Orion shining over there.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:53.520
It's called the Prayer Star, and people prayed to it for various matters since the old days.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:03:00.160
{CHIKYUU}The Prayer Star of Orion looked so far from Earth, but it's so close and large.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.360
{KITTO}It should grant
my wishes well.

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:06.670
Stars are just a composition
of carbon, hydrogen and water...

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.510
...yet you look
at it that way.

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:10.720
Girls are weird.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:12.500
So what did you ask ?

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.750
That's a secret.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:19.470
I know, it's about a successful
journey for the Yamato, isn't it ?

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:20.630
No.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:22.790
For the future of mankind ?

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:24.570
Totally different.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.310
What is it, then ?

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.920
What's wrong ?
Chief Engine Operator ?

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:46.970
Chief ?!

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:49.320
Nothing's wrong.
What is it ?

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:53.500
But we've slowed down 50 percent.
It must be an engine malfunction.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.420
Don't be ridiculous.
The engines are fine.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.370
It must be your
piloting mistake.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:03.070
No way !
It was on automatic !

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:04.620
This is weird.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:05.640
Hey, what's wrong ?

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.790
What happened ?

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.500
A barrier ?

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:18.920
Say what ?

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:23.210
There's a strong magnetic
barrier in the Orion sector.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:27.390
That shock was because
of the leading edge of the barrier.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:31.420
At this rate, the speed of
the ship will keep dropping...

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:33.150
...and it will be slowed by
half again in three minutes.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:35.740
We're in trouble.
I have to report to the Captain.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.790
What's wrong with the Captain ?

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:56.450
Usually, he makes a fuss, saying "Come
up in 30 seconds, if something happens."

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.480
Unidentified flying objects, detected.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:03.870
There're about fifty, distance 10,000 km.
Approaching at 0.02 space knots per second.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:07.210
What do you mean by
unidentified flying object ?

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:10.190
Captain...

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:12.180
Identify it in 10 seconds.

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:13.270
Aye, sir.

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:18.770
Identified !
They're missiles !

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:21.530
Full reverse.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:24.750
Main engine, maximum throttle.
Full astern.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.900
Full astern.
Steady.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:53.550
What's wrong, Chief Engine Operator ?!
It's not moving at all !

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:56.100
Don't be so fussy.
We're doing our best.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:59.790
The first wave of missiles
will impact in 20 seconds.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.140
The second wave will
impact in 40 seconds.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.200
Chief Engine Operator ?!

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:08.170
Fifteen seconds !

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.840
Chief Engine Operator Tokugawa !

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.920
The second wave will
impact in 20 seconds !

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:26.710
Full throttle !
Engine, full throttle !

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.790
Is that full throttle,
Chief Engine Operator ?!

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:34.770
We're at full throttle.

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:37.270
If you have any complaints,
come down and do it yourself.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.220
You, stupid old man !

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:41.720
Fifteen seconds !

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.540
Fourteen...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.000
...thirteen...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.450
...twelve...

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:47.770
...eleven...

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.030
...ten...

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:50.210
...nine...

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:51.770
...eight...

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.080
...seven...

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:13.420
I was desperate to
carry out my duty.

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:16.520
Do I still have
to apologize, Captain ?

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:19.850
In order to carry out your duty,
you must remain calm.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:23.770
{REISEI}Would a calm and thoughtful
person say "stupid old man ?"

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:24.840
Apologize.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.990
You're right.
I'm very sorry, Captain.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:31.000
Please, forgive me,
Chief Engine Operator Tokugawa.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.720
If you understand, it's okay.
I don't mind.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.960
We're on the same team.

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:38.320
Chief Engine Operator and
Chief Navigator, you may leave.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.670
Aye, sir. Chief Engine
Operator Tokugawa, leaving.

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:42.210
Chief Navigator Shima, leaving.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:49.770
Kodai.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:50.880
Sir ?

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:54.110
Who ordered you to fire
the intercept missiles ?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.200
I shouldn't have ?

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:58.450
Without question.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:04.170
But Captain, the Yamato survived
because I fired the missiles, didn't it ?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.630
I'm not talking about the outcome.
What I mean is the following of orders.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:12.870
You fired the missiles without
my order.  Am I wrong ?

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:16.790
Y...yes, you're right.
But, Captain...

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.220
Don't make excuses !

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.350
Captain...

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:26.840
I'm fine. {Leave.}

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:37.620
Planet Gamilus

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:44.820
Desler Palace

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:52.270
Lord Desler

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.300
Such impressive tactics,
Your Excellency.

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:58.770
General Hisu

00:08:56.300 --> 00:09:00.630
The Yamato was completely ensnared
by the magnetic barrier net.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:06.390
If the barrier is disturbed, the nearby base will
launch missiles, so they can't move carelessly.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:09.230
That's right.
Now, my next plan is...

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:34.050
It's a gas creature which
eats energy and matter.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:47.370
Did you see that, everyone ?
That's the fate of the Yamato.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.770
{KONO}That gas creature will attack
the Yamato from behind.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.820
{NIGEYOU}The barrier will prevent
them from getting away.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:56.570
{SON OUE}Also, the corona of the
giant red star, Alpha, is ahead.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:00.720
Eaten by the gas,
shattered by the missiles...

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:04.490
...or melted
by the corona...

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:07.810
{HOKA}Is there any other route
the Yamato can take ?

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:10.170
No, there shouldn't be.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.300
It's perfect, my Lord.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.050
Thank you, General.

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:17.600
I just came across the gas, but
I'm pleased that it'll be useful.

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:22.070
The same gas is waiting
on the battlefield of Orion.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:24.070
I guess it's
time to use it.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.330
That should do it.
Bandage.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.120
Okay.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.580
Let me do it.

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:48.280
May I ?

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:49.210
Go ahead.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:55.960
Tastes good.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.720
You can't judge a person or
an injury by the way they look.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.850
Be careful, Captain.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.510
Thank you.
I thought it was healed.

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:10.520
I heard that the
battle at Pluto was severe.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:13.770
Kodai's brother
died there, didn't he ?

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.750
I'm sorry.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:19.720
Oh, I shouldn't
have said that.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.390
Sorry.
I'm sorry.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.760
It's done, Doctor.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.130
Thank you, Sado.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.190
Take care.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.940
Oh, yeah...

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:32.200
Captain, I forgot
to tell you something.

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:41.170
You need hospital
treatment, Captain.

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:44.270
Hospital treatment,
for a wound like this ?

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:48.100
Your body isn't stable and it's
not only because of the wound.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:53.080
You know that.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.600
I saw your medical 
records back on Earth.

00:11:56.600 --> 00:12:00.910
I drink like taking a shower,
but my medical eyes aren't blind.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.420
Please, stay in the infirmary.

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:05.320
I can't be hospitalized.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.030
Captain.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:09.100
I'm responsible for the
operation of the ship.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:12.500
But you were slow to order the
missile launch today, right ?

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:19.280
What will you do if it affects
your commander's duties ?

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:23.650
Please come to the infirmary. Your
space radiation injury is progressing.

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:46.200
Strange. It's gas.
Gas is approaching from behind.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:47.900
Gas, he said ?

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:49.170
Gas ?

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.000
It's corrosive gas !  We have to get away,
or the ship will be destroyed !

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:01.450
Emergency start, Shima.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:08.900
What's the matter ?

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:17.400
Engine, full throttle.

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.430
There's an opening in
the barrier at ten o'clock.

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:40.760
That's the only path to avoid the
missiles and get away from the gas.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:42.920
Captain ?!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:46.330
But there's the Alpha
at ten o'clock.

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.550
Say what ?

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.320
We have to enter
the sea of flame.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:58.180
Damn, they must
have set us up.

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:00.700
Captain, what do
we do ?  Captain ?

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:09.800
Flank speed to ten o'clock.

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.890
Aye.  Flank speed
to ten o'clock.

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.720
But Captain, it'll be like
entering a blast furnace !

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:20.900
The ship will melt !

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:47.070
So, Okita's chosen to die in flames.
It's only a matter of time.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.960
I'm retiring
to my quarters.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.170
Please relax, Your Excellency.

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:55.920
Once it's over,
I'll report to you.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.050
There's no need, Hisu.

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:01.070
If I have to hear about every tiny detail,
such as the end of the Yamato...

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:03.670
...I'll be too busy, and my
body won't be able to take it.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.560
Long live my Lord !

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:11.230
Long live my Lord !

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.650
Close all protective shutters !

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:46.520
Shima, evade those flames,
and skirt the barrier.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:48.820
Evade those flames,
and go forward.

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.460
Are you alright, Shima ?

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:55.850
Shut up.  Be quiet.

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.890
Ohta, calculate the
motion of the flames.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:00.270
Roger.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:04.170
Captain, let's put
on space suits.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.620
They can withstand
up to 800 degrees.

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:07.670
Proceed.

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:11.870
All hands, put on
space suits immediately !

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:15.300
Captain !

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:19.950
Doctor !
Dr. Sado, hurry !

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:22.180
Oh, my God.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.330
Doctor, you forgot this !

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.420
You idiot !  How can a doctor
work in a suit like that ?!

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:29.750
Doctor !

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.300
Okay.

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:33.540
Hey, stop the ship !

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:35.070
Where the hell're
you going ?!

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:37.130
Are you trying to
kill the Captain ?!

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.600
But, Dr. Sado...

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:41.750
I said stop !
Can't you listen to a doctor ?!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.020
You don't have to stop.

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.160
Captain...?

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:48.870
Mori, thanks.
My old wound ached a bit.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:57.050
I can't put up with a wound like this ?
I'm getting old, aren't I, Doctor ?

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.830
Well, anyway, let me
check your pulse.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.820
It's nothing.

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:12.410
I'll give you a shot,
but be careful.

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.810
Otherwise, you'll have
to be hospitalized.

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:18.320
I know, Doctor.

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.620
I'm relieved.
I almost panicked.

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:53.450
Be careful. Even if it's flame, it's a
dozen times bigger than the Yamato.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:18:00.600
There's an irregularity at 2K 23.
There's an irregularity at 2K 23.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.010
Roger.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:07.610
Irregularity at MAN 422 port, too.
Moving to SK 700.

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:08.880
Go low right.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:09.970
Roger.

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:16.890
It's so hot.
It's bad for your health.

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:21.070
The ship's exterior
temperature is 1200 degrees.

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:23.250
Interior temperature
is 400 degrees.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:26.280
One more hour, so do your best.
We'll get through.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:29.970
Chief ?!  Chief Engine Operator
Tokugawa, we're losing thrust !

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:33.030
If we slow down, we'll be
dragged in by Alpha's gravity.

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:35.860
Say what ?  What's the matter
with the gravity ?  I can't hear you.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:38.790
Engine output is decreasing !
Please hurry !

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:38.790
I got it !

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.170
Check the engines !

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.920
Hurry !
Hang in there !

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.790
What's your problem with this heat ?
Haven't you ever been in a sauna ?

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.620
Currently, we are at
300,000 km from Alpha.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.280
The corona is causing
the electromagnetic field.

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:05.540
The gas to the rear is
getting more active.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:07.720
Chief Navigator,
it's burning.

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:19.170
I get it.
Poison quells poison.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:20.630
That was your plan, Captain.

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:29.360
There's a big corona ahead !
It's an irregularity, and not predicted !

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:39.280
It's too big,
and it's getting higher.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.260
Can you evade it, Shima ?

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.520
No, the ship is
moving too fast.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.610
Then slow down.

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:51.300
No, we'll be pulled
in by Alpha's gravity.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.310
Kodai.

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:55.210
Yes ?

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.300
Fire the Wave Motion Gun.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:00.730
Shoot the flame with
the Wave Motion Gun ?

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:02.130
Must I repeat myself ?!

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.530
No, I'll fire the
Wave Motion Gun.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:14.510
Aim at the pillar 500 km
straight ahead, Kodai.

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:17.010
Leave it to me.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:24.770
Approaching corona !
30 seconds left !

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:35.630
Fire !

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:19.360
What is it, Hisu ?

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:20.550
Enter.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:29.370
Your Excellency,
it's about the Yamato.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:33.350
I told you, you don't have to
report the end of the Yamato.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.720
Well, actually...

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:37.190
...they got through.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.320
Say what ?

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:42.500
Your gas was lured into the
corona and incinerated.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:46.720
The Yamato cut through the
corona with its Wave Motion Gun.

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.340
It was a splendid operation.

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:50.690
Should I send a congratulatory
message to Okita ?

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:52.270
Message ?

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:53.390
General Hisu ?

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:54.170
Sir ?

00:21:55.170 --> 00:21:56.900
Are you stupid, or what ?

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:01.100
That's enough.
Go get some rest.

00:22:01.100 --> 00:22:02.620
Yes, sir.
Long live my Lord !

00:22:30.050 --> 00:22:31.170
Well ?

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:33.000
That was the true
identity of the Prayer Star.

00:22:34.070 --> 00:22:36.520
Now you know how
terrifying a star can be.

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:41.050
No. As long as I have wishes,
a prayer star is a prayer star.

00:22:42.020 --> 00:22:45.560
You don't give up.
What was your wish ?

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:47.120
I said, it's a secret.

00:22:47.120 --> 00:22:48.860
You can tell me, can't you ?

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:50.170
Well, okay.

00:22:50.170 --> 00:22:55.750
My wish is to make a
person fall in love with me.

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:58.490
Oh, that's it ?
That's silly.

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:02.620
Hey, who's that person ?

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:06.420
That's definitely a secret.

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.380
Hey, Yuki.
Yuki, tell me.

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.770
As long as space exists,
life will be born.

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:21.740
But when will green
return to the Earth ?

00:23:21.740 --> 00:23:24.110
Hurry to Iscandar, Yamato.

00:23:24.110 --> 00:23:27.620
Due to the radioactive poison
from the Gamilus meteor bombs...

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:30.790
...mankind will be
extinct in 308 days.

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:36.570
308 days till the destruction of Earth

00:23:30.790 --> 00:23:33.320
Only 308 days are left.

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:43.760
Okita Juzo:

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:43.760
Naya Goro

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:49.270
Mori Yuki:

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:49.270
Asagami Yoko

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:54.770
Desler:

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:54.770
Ibu Masayuki

00:23:55.020 --> 00:24:04.520
Note:
The Yamato was trapped by Desler at the Alpha of Orion about 980-1500 light years away from Earth.

00:24:04.520 --> 00:24:14.520
Note:
Originally, Dr. Sado's assistant was a chubby woman, and the voice was supposed to be done by Eiko Koizumi.

00:24:04.520 --> 00:24:14.520
However, the female crew was limited to Yuki after Ep. 11, so it was redrawn as a guy.

00:24:04.520 --> 00:24:14.520
But it couldn't have been corrected in the scene, where she was following Dr. Sado, holding his space suit.

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:24.520
Note:
In the manga version by Leiji Matsumoto, it was the Beta of Orion.  Strictly speaking, the large pillar of corona is called a prominence.

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:30.470
Note:
There are 308 days left till the extinction of mankind, which means it was December 23d, the 55th day after departure.

